      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRANKS ALOT (6) covered some ground from a similar draw to this but worked home in impressive style to cruise home by 15.6 metres at Maryborough last start. That was just his second start so expect there is more to come. Could go through his grades. WAIKARE ADRIENNA (2) showed good improvement when she came from wider and scored by 7.6 metres at Shepparton last time out. Has won when third-up before and should have no excuses from this advantageous draw so could back that up. CREATABLE (5) should be ready to peak after improving last time out, edged out narrowly into second at Maryborough. EMMWALLEN (7) has been let down by manners so far this time in but has trialled well since the last outing. Has won two of three attempts at this circuit and distance so is good enough.",
